e traditional rhythm games that keep you locked in place, <i>Claviator</i> lets you <strong>move freely through 3D environments</strong> while staying in sync with the beat. Whether you\u2019re playing solo, teaming up in co-op, or facing off in PvP, Claviator blends rhythm mechanics with movement and multiplayer interaction for a fun and flexible experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.poster.avif?t=1766417374\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.webm?t=1766417374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.mp4?t=1766417374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>story-driven challenges</strong>, battle it out in <strong>five distinct PvP modes</strong>, and choose between <strong>4-note or 8-note input systems</strong> to match your skill level and play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, meet <strong>8 charming Rhythm Animals</strong>: <strong>BIRB, MONK, GEK, SNEK, BOOP, CHONK, SQUB,</strong> and <strong>FINN</strong>. Time your moves across three buttons and hit Space to land the perfect note!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.poster.avif?t=1766417374\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.webm?t=1766417374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.mp4?t=1766417374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Gameplay with Freedom to Move</strong>:\u00a0Hit notes in time while exploring fully 3D worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure in rhythm: </strong>walk, jump, and navigate the world as you complete each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Music Library</strong>:\u00a0Play a variety of well-known songs and original compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>:\u00a0Team up with friends or compete head-to-head in 5 unique PvP game types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode with Claviator</strong>:\u00a0Join your guide on a lighthearted journey through musical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Input Options</strong>:\u00a0Choose between 4-note or 8-note control setups for an accessible or more advanced rhythm experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI Controller Support:\u00a0</strong>Play using MIDI drums and controllers for a true rhythm-game experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re aiming for a high score, progressing through story quests, or just playing casually with friends, <strong>Claviator\u00a0</strong>offers a rhythm experience that\u2019s both creative and approachable.</p>","developers":["Zero Inches"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/30e27a37eae9f5d1281a3f8cd5ee8f199ce4a6e3/header.jpg?t=1766417374","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","rec